T_S с fallback на DROID_BRIDGE_LIVE_WRITE_TIMEOUT_S.\"\"\"\nserver.py:396:    for key in (\"BRIDGE_CLIENT_WRITE_TIMEOUT_S\", \"DROID_BRIDGE_LIVE_WRITE_TIMEOUT_S\"):\nserver.py:409:LIVE_WRITE_TIMEOUT_S: float = parse_live_write_timeout(30.0)\nserver.py:411:FIRST_TOKEN_TIMEOUT_S = float(\nserver.py:412:    os.environ.get(\"DROID_BRIDGE_FIRST_TOKEN_TIMEOUT_S\", \"90\")\nserver.py:731:RPC_CALL_TIMEOUT_S = float(os.environ.get(\"DROID_BRIDGE_RPC_CALL_TIMEOUT_S\", \"60\"))\nserver.py:1704:    \"\"\"Нет ответа на служебный запрос за RPC_CALL_TIMEOUT_S.\"\"\"\nserver.py:2444:        end = time.monotonic() + (RPC_CALL_TIMEOUT_S if timeout is None else timeout)\nserver.py:2456:                    f\"{method}: no response within {RPC_CALL_TIMEOUT_S:g}s\"\nserver.py:3353:def _projection_digest(text: str, tool_calls: list) -> str:\nserver.py:3358:        \"tool_calls\": [\nserver.py:3360:            for tc in tool_calls\nserver.py:3699:class Run:\nserver.py:4640:    projection = _projection_digest(out.get(\"text\") or \"\", out.get(\"tool_calls\") or [])\nserver.py:4977:        \"\"\"Ждём слот семафора до QUEUE_TIMEOUT_S, попутно keepalive и проверка клиента.\"\"\"\nserver.py:4983:            if time.monotonic() - waited > QUEUE_TIMEOUT_S:\nserver.py:4993:    def _execute(\nserver.py:5000:        \"\"\"Гнать ход до конца; сквозной таймаут TIMEOUT_S на весь ход.\nserver.py:5011:        ToolCallParser (в живом ходе — в strict_live режиме: сырой `<tool_call>` не утечёт).\nserver.py:5016:        tool_calls: list = []\nserver.py:5020:        deadline = time.monotonic() + min(TIMEOUT_S, SAFETY_CAP_S)\nserver.py:5047:                \"tool_calls\": tool_calls,\nserver.py:5052:        # с LIVE_WRITE_TIMEOUT_S сигналит об этом провалом sse_writer. Вычисление хода и\nserver.py:5116:                \"index\": len(tool_calls),\nserver.py:5124:            tool_calls.append(entry)\nserver.py:5125:            events.append((\"tool_call\", entry))\nserver.py:5159:                return state(\"